#: ../../user_interface/timeline.rst:385
msgid "Adding Tracks"
msgstr "Stopy"

#: ../../user_interface/timeline.rst:387
msgid ""
"In order to add a track, right-click anywhere in the track header area. In "
"the **Add Track** dialog window specify what type of track, where and how "
"many you want to insert."
msgstr ""
"Ak chcete pridať stopu, kliknite pravým tlačidlom myši kdekoľvek v oblasti "
"hlavičky stopy. V dialógovom okne **Pridať stopu** zadajte typ stopy, kde a "
"koľko ich chcete vložiť."

#: ../../user_interface/timeline.rst:395
msgid ""
"You can specify the number of tracks for a new project in :menuselection:"
"`Menu --> Settings --> Configure Kdenlive` in the :doc:`Project Defaults </"
"getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_project_defaults>` tab."
msgstr ""
"Počet stôp pre nový projekt môžete nastaviť v :menuselection:`Ponuka --> "
"Nastavenia --> Konfigurovať Kdenlive` na karte :doc:`/getting_started/"
"configure_kdenlive/configuration_project_defaults`."

