msgid ""
"Tracks can only be reordered between same type (audio or video). To reorder "
"tracks, right-click anywhere in the track header area and select :guilabel:"
"`Move Track Up` or :guilabel:`Move Track Down`. You can undo the reordering "
"by using :kbd:`Ctrl+Z` or :menuselection:`Menu --> Edit --> Undo`."
